			"notes": "# Version 2.4 Changelog (1.20.4)\n![tooltip-showcase](https://github.com/Cameronwasnthere/Strange-Berries/assets/80855115/af965453-e32a-4ca9-b12b-b21a999b5a24)\n\n- Added the ability to view what blocks a berry can be planted on by holding [SHIFT] whilst hovering over one\n- Added Brazilian Portuguese translations (Thanks to sevlnho)\n- Slightly altered the berry sickness level icon and position\n- Foxes and Bees are now able to gain a bush's effect on collision\n- Collision with a Warped Fire Berry bush no longer sets an entity on fire and instead does normal berry bush damage\n- Undead entities no longer gain regeneration from Regeneration Berry Bushes rather it has no effect\n- Undead entities no longer gain healing from Healing Berry Bushes and Fruitful Berry Bushes, instead they are inflicted high amounts of damage (harming)\n- Night berry bushes no longer drop night berries when broken during the day\n- Added a message which will appear when you attempt to harvest night berries during the day\n\n_Please note that the \"more details\" on each berry aswell as the new night berries message have not yet been localised and currently only show in English_"
		},
